grebe bundles third-party material.

## DuckDB PEG grammar

crates/grebe-syntax/vendor/grammar/ is a verbatim copy of the PEG grammar
from the DuckDB source tree. It is never edited; vendor/SNAPSHOT records the
exact upstream commit.

    Source:  https://github.com/duckdb/duckdb
    Path:    src/parser/peg/grammar
    License: MIT, full text in crates/grebe-syntax/vendor/LICENSE-DuckDB

crates/grebe-rules/vendor/aggregates.list is derived data: the names of
DuckDB's built-in aggregate functions, extracted from a DuckDB build.

grebe itself is MIT licensed; see LICENSE.
